# UniWorkers – System Design

A school-only marketplace connecting Spartans with student service providers. Browse freely; sign up only when you avail a service.

## 1. User Flow

```mermaid
flowchart TD
A[Guest opens site] --> B[Browse / search / filter services]
B --> C[View listing and worker profile]
C --> D{Clicks Hire / Book}
D -->|Not logged in| E[Sign up with school email + OTP]
E --> F[Return to same listing]
D -->|Logged in| F
F --> G[Fill booking: package, notes, schedule]
G --> H{Worker response}
H -->|Declines| I[Client notified, can rebook others]
H -->|Counter-offer| G
H -->|Accepts| J[Order in progress + chat]
J --> K[Worker delivers]
K --> L{Client confirms}
L -->|Dispute| M[Admin mediation]
L -->|Confirms| N[Payment released]
M --> N
N --> O[Both leave reviews]
```

